<title>USA: Boatmen's Bancshares Inc Q3 net off.</title>
<headline>Boatmen's Bancshares Inc Q3 net off.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.79		   $ 0.84</p>
<p> Net			125,300		  133,700</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 includes $18.1 million merger expenses and $23.6 million Savings Association Insurance Fund charge. Excluding these items, Q3 earnings were $152.5 million or $0.96/shr.  </p>
<p>		  9 MONTHS</p>
