<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month results include merger expenses of $60.5 million and SAIF assessment of $23.6 million in 1996 and merger expenses of $26 million in 1995.  Excluding these items, earnings were $439.1 million or $2.76/shr vs $385.2 million or $2.42/shr.</p>
